  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Maprotiline is an antidepressant used to treat depression, and has also been used for conditions such as anxiety, pain, and bulimia nervosa. It is an approved drug, though not authorised in the European Union, and is used relatively little today.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q418361&quot;>Wikidata Q418361</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>maprotiline</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>N06AA21</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00934&quot;>DB00934</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/4011&quot;>4011</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:6690&quot;>6690</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q418361&quot;>Q418361</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C20H23N</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>277.411 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
